Chapter: VectorWideNoAvx
  cites Foreword chapter Console

Section: Entry

 Under `-no-avx` codex-vm has no AVX, so a program using a 256-bit vector
 must refuse before `opening` runs: the lane line below must never print.

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    let v = vec4d-splat 1.5 + vec4d-splat 2.0
    in act
      print-line-uni ("lane " & show (vec4d-extract v 0))
    end
  end
